    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac26aff345c86bfd",
      "translationZh": "我一直在做一些东西，起初是我的 Hierarchos 架构的训练后端，但它已经发展成一个更广泛的项目：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "662a5781544fb3bd",
      "translationZh": "Hierarchos Native 现在包含一个原生的 Rust + Vulkan 后端，用于在 143 个规范的 Transformer 架构上进行训练和推理，额外的 Hugging Face model_type 别名使当前宣传的注册表达到 224 种模型类型拼写。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1906c90201744b47",
      "translationZh": "我最想分享的部分实际上不再是 Hierarchos 本身，而是它底层的 Transformer 后端。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0528a9f5d61f6c0",
      "translationZh": "目标是探索现代 Transformer 生态系统有多少可以直接在 Vulkan 计算上实现，而不是假设 CUDA + PyTorch 作为默认执行栈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c5279ef3a9fd28c",
      "translationZh": "后端目前包含以下内容的原生实现：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
