      "translationZh": "原生生成/推理路径",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d86e6068962744b0",
      "translationZh": "支持的架构注册表涵盖包括 Llama、Qwen、Gemma、Mistral/Mixtral、DeepSeek、Phi、OLMo、Granite、Cohere、BERT 系列模型、T5/BART 系列模型以及许多其他模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1affb8b2c24e6d97",
      "translationZh": "还有针对架构的 Vulkan 内核，用于较新的模型设计，而不是试图通过一个通用近似来强制所有内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e24461ed6fe0005b",
      "translationZh": "我想特别注意的一件事是：我并不声称这目前是 CUDA/PyTorch 的替代品，也不认为支持某种模型类型就自动意味着该模型的所有可能配置和多模态组件都已经经过验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a79bca710455638a",
      "translationZh": "架构注册表描述了原生文本图实现。多模态包可能包含不属于原生文本后端的视觉/音频等塔，且实际兼容性仍需在更广泛的模型和硬件上进行测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "218fd22d80f2e48a",
      "translationZh": "我认为有趣的是，这展示了一个方向。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60db31fb57a6d4ae",
      "translationZh": "Vulkan 在 NVIDIA、AMD、Intel 以及大量集成/移动级硬件上均可用。如果像这样的原生训练栈能够成熟，那么可能存在空间来构建与单一供应商计算生态系统关联度大幅降低的 ML 训练基础设施。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba3902289aa83740",
      "translationZh": "我在 AMD RDNA 3 硬件上进行了开发和测试，包括 ROG Ally Z1 Extreme，这也有助于暴露在仅围绕高端 CUDA 系统开发 ML 软件时容易被忽视的假设。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa790c1ab772e39b",
      "translationZh": "该仓库包含 Rust 源代码、Vulkan 计算着色器/SPIR-V、CLI、Hierarchos 运行时、架构文档、验证工具以及独立打包支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38fcfb1b422fea88",
      "translationZh": "支持的架构列表如下：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c49e3e655965b54",
      "translationZh": "而且主要的 README 现在包含了构建后端、检查 Vulkan 设备、训练 Hugging Face 模型、LoRA 微调、推理以及训练 Hierarchos 本身的示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "052d384cf2ccaa93",
      "translationZh": "我特别希望得到以下领域工作人员的反馈：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e5866bfe65575d2",
      "translationZh": "Vulkan 计算、ML 编译器/运行时设计、GPU 内核、PyTorch 替代方案、AMD/Intel ML、便携式训练系统或 Transformer 架构实现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "394a3258f8d9e9b7",
      "translationZh": "在做出强有力的性能声明之前，仍有许多工作需要进行基准测试、硬件验证、优化和独立测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8bcfda3e90e6e22",
      "translationZh": "但让如此多的现代架构图在原生 Vulkan 导向的训练系统中运行，让我认为除了原始 Hierarchos 项目之外，这里可能确实有某种有用的东西。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e269b5740f1f5d71",
      "translationZh": "我对技术批评、架构兼容性报告、其他 GPU 的基准测试，或者想要对后端进行压力测试的贡献者非常感兴趣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cdf8e69b4edfac8",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/PhysicsDisastrous462 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
